<title>MEXICO: Mexico and European Union seen starting talks soon.</title>
<headline>Mexico and European Union seen starting talks soon.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico and the European Union will start negotiations on June 10 for a political, economic and trade pact, the delegation of the European Commission in Mexico said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The next week, the 10th and 11th of June, we will start negotiations between Mexico and the EU for a new political pact, of cooperation and trade between Mexico and the EU,&quot; the chief of the delegation, Jacques Lecomte, told reporters.</p>
<p>Speaking at the Second EU-Mexico Auto Parts Forum, he said that the talks will initially focus more on the political aspects and then will turn more towards trade in 1998.</p>
<p>((-- Veronica Galan, Mexico newsroom + 525 728 9553)</p>
